# Global Project Guidelines

- ALWAYS ensure that any newly generated or sourced images are strictly optimized and converted to the `.webp` format.
- ALWAYS apply proper image compression to ensure maximum performance. You do not need to ask the user, just automatically write a Node/Sharp script (or similar) to optimize newly created images. 
- The project follows a sleek, dark-themed UI pattern using Tailwind CSS. When modifying components, retain the existing design language (e.g. glassmorphism `backdrop-blur`, dark translucent backgrounds).
